Show how to connect an MCP client (Claude, Cursor, Windsurf) to Vendo

Usage: vendo mcp [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json      Output only the mcpServers JSON block
      --show-key  Embed your actual API key instead of a ${VENDO_API_KEY} placeholder
  -h, --help      Print help

Global options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics

Examples:
  $ vendo mcp
  $ vendo mcp --json
  $ vendo mcp --show-key
